# DineAI Ranking & Multi-Objective Optimization Framework

Implement a production-grade, SOLID-compliant, and highly explainable ranking engine in [ranking.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/retrieval/ranking.py). It operates entirely on already-filtered candidates (represented as `CandidateFilterResult` inside a `FilteringResult` from [filtering.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/retrieval/filtering.py)) and computes rankings based on customizable factors or multi-objective functions.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The ranking engine operates under two distinct paradigms depending on configuration:
> 1. **Factor-based Ranking**: Standard linear/weighted scoring of individual candidate metrics (e.g. Price, Rating, Semantics).
> 2. **Multi-Objective Ranking**: Multi-attribute decision-making utilizing customizable and potentially conflicting business/user objectives (e.g. maximize protein, minimize price, maximize margin).
> We will expose a clean public API that seamlessly routes the request to the correct strategy or optimizer.

